  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with or perpetuate anti-Asian racist stereotypes, particularly those who mock Asian drivers' perceived driving abilities. This includes people who engage with or spread harmful tropes such as the 'model minority' myth weaponization and driving ability mockery. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences who find humor in or are complicit in anti-Asian racism, often by reinforcing the idea that Asian drivers are inherently dangerous and deserving of memorialization after fatal accidents. The audience may also include those who consume internet memes that rely on racialized humor or who are unaware of the harmful implications of such imagery.",
